Z||000001||My7Fieros||08-08-2000||01:15 AM||||A two seater huh! Man, thats one RARE Fiero!!!<BR>SE is the mid range Fiero..between the basic and the GT. They can have either a 4 or 6 cylinder engine. The 85s looked like a basic, but could be had w/ a 6 cylinder. The 86 and 87s had the aero effects, but a notchback. There were no SEs in 88. There are some minor things also on SEs...but I believe you said you have a 4 banger, and its a kit car...so theres no telling what it is.....<BR>Also, to check the responses you get on your post, you dont have to post a new question everytime...just click on your question and youll automatically see your responses.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 08-08-2000).]||||reg||1
